  DialogueHandler: {fileID: 150644561}
  dialogueList:
  - FAR INTO THE FUTURE, A TIME MACHINE IS BUILT.
  - THE MACHINE IS CONTROLLED BY A KEYBOARD.
  - THE CREATOR SEEKS TO CREATE THE PERFECT KEYBOARD, MADE FROM MATERIAL ACROSS TIME.
  - HE TRIES TO PUT IN THE TIME PERIOD FOR [REDACTED], BUT HIS TYPING SKILLS NEED WORK.
  - HE MISINPUTS THE TARGET AND INSTEAD GETS TRANSPORTED TO THE PREHISTORIC PERIOD.
  - "IN ORDER TO MAKE HIS WAY BACK, HE MUST BECOME THE\u2026"
